  ExpressionUUID->"4c5427ba-1f0b-4c72-ac89-e8bb1f7acff4"],
 " is defined for integer and half-integer ",
 Cell[BoxData[
 "s"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"99e1a524-de0a-41f0-86a0-c7271ffb9fec"],
